branches are byte-unchanged, and MGUARD.log carries the one-line diff the branch produced).

ADDENDUM 2, written BEFORE its leg (this file's mtime against M_resinst.raw): the undriven-code conjunct class that all three pass-2
seats named independently (Fable `&& expevt != EXPEVT_ADDR_ERR_ST'; Grok `&& expevt != EXPEVT_RES_INST'; Argon `&& expevt !=
EXPEVT_TLB_MISS') -- an exemption ADDED at a code the table does not drive -- is measured ONCE so the clause-(e) disclosure rests on a
