instruction under BL, so no row's EXPEVT moves; the guest-visible difference is a reserved instruction executed with BL set reading
H'180 where the fix gives H'020.  If it escapes as predicted it is FILED as coverage debt (the carrier: an above-floor measured escape is
filed, with the escape list recorded), not repaired in-round: the class has more members (every undriven code) than rows could close,
no body-tested partition puts it on the floor, and the contract discloses it in both directions.

